    "enUS": {
      "description": "Jereman is fortunate to be alive. It sounds like she fled from the lodge in quite the hurry, no doubt thrilled to be freed from her predicament. \r\n\r\nShe will wish to speak with you. Go, find her.",
      "summary": "Return to Jereman at the Cradle of Tranquility.",
